{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type SingleModifierHotkey = \n  | `Control+${Key}`\n  | `Alt+${Key}`\n  | `Shift+${Key}`\n  | `Meta+${Key}`\n  | `Mod+${Key}`;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/hotkey.types.ts#L18","children":[{"type":"text","value":"hotkey.types.ts:18"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Single modifier + key combinations.\nUses canonical modifiers (4) + Mod (1) = 5 modifiers."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod"},{"type":"text","value":" modifier is platform-adaptive:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"macOS"}]},{"type":"text","value":": Resolves to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Meta"},{"type":"text","value":" (Command key ⌘)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Windows/Linux"}]},{"type":"text","value":": Resolves to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Control"},{"type":"text","value":" (Ctrl key)"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This enables cross-platform hotkey definitions that automatically adapt to the platform.\nFor example, "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod+S"},{"type":"text","value":" becomes "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Command+S"},{"type":"text","value":" on Mac and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Ctrl+S"},{"type":"text","value":" on Windows/Linux."}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype SingleModifierHotkey = \n  | `Control+${Key}`\n  | `Alt+${Key}`\n  | `Shift+${Key}`\n  | `Meta+${Key}`\n  | `Mod+${Key}`;\n```\n\nDefined in: [hotkey.types.ts:18](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/hotkey.types.ts#L18)\n\nSingle modifier + key combinations.\nUses canonical modifiers (4) + Mod (1) = 5 modifiers.\n\nThe `Mod` modifier is platform-adaptive:\n- **macOS**: Resolves to `Meta` (Command key ⌘)\n- **Windows/Linux**: Resolves to `Control` (Ctrl key)\n\nThis enables cross-platform hotkey definitions that automatically adapt to the platform.\nFor example, `Mod+S` becomes `Command+S` on Mac and `Ctrl+S` on Windows/Linux.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: SingleModifierHotkey\ntitle: SingleModifierHotkey\n---\n\n```ts\ntype SingleModifierHotkey = \n  | `Control+${Key}`\n  | `Alt+${Key}`\n  | `Shift+${Key}`\n  | `Meta+${Key}`\n  | `Mod+${Key}`;\n```\n\nDefined in: [hotkey.types.ts:18](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/hotkey.types.ts#L18)\n\nSingle modifier + key combinations.\nUses canonical modifiers (4) + Mod (1) = 5 modifiers.\n\nThe `Mod` modifier is platform-adaptive:\n- **macOS**: Resolves to `Meta` (Command key ⌘)\n- **Windows/Linux**: Resolves to `Control` (Ctrl key)\n\nThis enables cross-platform hotkey definitions that automatically adapt to the platform.\nFor example, `Mod+S` becomes `Command+S` on Mac and `Ctrl+S` on Windows/Linux.\n"}
